#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 12
#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Common settings for all desktops"
msgstr "Paramètres comuns a totes los burèus"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 13
#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"If you want the same background settings to be applied to all desktops "
"enable this option."
msgstr ""
"Marcatz aquesta case se volètz que los meteisses paramètres de rière plan "
"s'aplique a totes los burèus."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 17
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Common settings for all screens"
msgstr "Paramètres comuns a totes los escrans"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 18
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"If you want the same background settings to be applied to all screens enable "
"this option."
msgstr ""
"Marcatz aquesta casa se volètz que los meteisses paramètres de rière plan "
"s'apliquen a totes los escrans."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 22
#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Draw backgrounds per screen"
msgstr "Dessenhar los rière plans per escran"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 23
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"If you want to draw to each screen seperately in xinerama mode enable this "
"option."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 27
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Limit background cache"
msgstr "Limitar l'amagatl del rière plan"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 28
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want to limit the cache size for the background."
msgstr ""
"Activatz aquesta opcion se volètz limitar la talha de l'amagatal del rière "
"plan"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 32
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Background cache size"
msgstr "Talha de l'amagatal del fons d'escran"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 33
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"Here you can enter how much memory KDE should use for caching the background"
"(s). If you have different backgrounds for the different desktops caching "
"can make switching desktops smoother at the expense of higher memory use."
msgstr ""
"Podètz picar aicí la quantitat de memòria que KDE deu utilizar per metre en "
"amagatal los fonses d'ecran. Se n'avètz mai d'un, la mesa en amagatal "
"fludifica lo passatge d'un burèu a l'autre, mas consoma mai de memòria."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 39
#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Show icons on desktop"
msgstr "Mostrar las icònas sul burèu"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 40
#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option if you do not want to have icons on the desktop. Without "
"icons the desktop will be somewhat faster but you will no longer be able to "
"drag files to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Desmarcatz aquesta opcion se volètz pas d'icònz sul burèu. Aquò pòt rendre "
"lo burèu mai rapid mas perdretz la possibilitat de lissar / depausar de "
"fichièrs sul burèu."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 44
#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Allow programs in desktop window"
msgstr "Autorizar los programas a utilizar la fenèstra del burèu"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 45
#: rc.cpp:42
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run X11 programs that draw into the desktop "
"such as xsnow, xpenguin or xmountain. If you have problems with applications "
"like netscape that check the root window for running instances, disable this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Marcatz aquesta opcion se desiratz utilizar de programas X11 que dessenhan "
"dirèctament sul burèu, coma « xsnow », « xpenguin » o « xmountain ». Se aquò "
"crea de problèmas amb d'aplicacions coma Netscape (qu'analiza la fenèstra "
"raiç (lo fons del burèu) per i cercar d'instàncias d'ele meteis), desmarcatz "
"aquesta opcion."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 56
#: rc.cpp:47
msgid "Automatically line up icons"
msgstr "Alinhar las icònas automaticament"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 57
#: rc.cpp:50
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to see your icons automatically aligned to the "
"grid when you move them."
msgstr ""
"Validatz aquesta opcion se volètz afichar automaticament las icònas "
"alignadas sus una gresilha quand las desplaçatz."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 61
#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 176
#: rc.cpp:53 rc.cpp:141
msgid "Sort directories first"
msgstr "Los repertòris en primièr"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 72
#: rc.cpp:57
msgid "Mouse wheel over desktop background switches desktop"
msgstr ""
"La rodeta de la mirga al dessús del rière plan d'un burèu cambia de burèu"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 73
#: rc.cpp:60
msgid ""
"You can switch between the virtual desktops by using the mouse wheel over "
"the desktop background."
msgstr ""
"Podètz bascuolar d'un burèu virtual a l'autre en utilizant la rodeta de la "
"mirga al dessús del fons d'escran del burèu."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 84
#: rc.cpp:65
msgid "Terminal application"
msgstr "Emulator de terminal"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 85
#: rc.cpp:68
msgid "Defines which terminal application is used."
msgstr "Definís l'emulator de terminal d'utilizar."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 89
#: rc.cpp:71
msgid "Left Mouse Button Action"
msgstr "Accion del boton esquèrra de la mirga"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 90
#: rc.cpp:74
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the left button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Podètz causir çò que se passa quand clicatz sul boton esquèrre de vòstre "
"periferic de puntatge sul burèu."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 94
#: rc.cpp:77
msgid "Middle Mouse Button Action"
msgstr "Accion del boton central de la mirga"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 95
#: rc.cpp:80
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the middle button of your "
"pointing device on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Podètz causir çò que se passa quand clicatz sul bouton central de vòstre "
"periferic de puntatge sul burèu."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 99
#: rc.cpp:83
msgid "Right Mouse Button Action"
msgstr "Accion del boton drech de la mirga"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 100
#: rc.cpp:86
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the right button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Podètz causir çò que se passa quand clicatz sul boton drech de vòstre "
"periferic de puntatge sul burèu."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 106
#: rc.cpp:89
msgid "KDE major version number"
msgstr "Numèro màger de la version de KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 111
#: rc.cpp:93
msgid "KDE minor version number"
msgstr "Numèro menor de la version de KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 116
#: rc.cpp:97
msgid "KDE release version number"
msgstr "Numèro de mesa a jorn de la version de KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 123
#: rc.cpp:101
msgid "Normal text color used for icon labels"
msgstr "Color de primièr plan del tèxt de las icònas"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 127
#: rc.cpp:105
msgid "Background color used for icon labels"
msgstr "Color de rière plan del tèxt de las icònas"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 132
#: rc.cpp:109
msgid "Enable text shadow"
msgstr "Activar l'ombra del tèxt"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 133
#: rc.cpp:112
msgid ""
"Check here to enable a shadow outline around the desktop font. This also "
"improves the readability of the desktop text against backgrounds of a "
"similar color."
msgstr ""
"Clicatz aicí per activar un ombratge a l'entorn de la poliça del burèu. Aquò "
"melhorarà la lisibilitat del tèxt del burèu plaçat sus un fons d'escran "
"d'una color similara."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 146
#: rc.cpp:117
msgid "Show hidden files"
msgstr "Visualizar los fichièrs amagats"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 147
#: rc.cpp:120
msgid ""
"<p>If you check this option, any files in your desktop directory that begin "
"with a period (.) will be shown. Usually, such files contain configuration "
"information, and remain hidden from view.</p>\\n<p>For example, files which "
"are named \\\".directory\\\" are plain text files which contain information "
"for Konqueror, such as the icon to use in displaying a directory, the order "
"in which files should be sorted, etc. You should not change or delete these "
"files unless you know what you are doing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Se marcatz aquesta casa, los fichièrs de vòstre burèu començant per un "
"punt (.) seràn afichats. Costumièrament, aquestes fichièrs contenon "
"d'entresenhas de configuracion, e demòran amagats.</p>\\n<p>Per exemple, los "
"fichièrs nomenats \\\".directory\\\" son de fichièrs tèxt contenent "
"d'entresenhas per Konqueror, coma l'icòna d'utilizar per afichar un dorsièr, "
"l'òrdre dins loqual triar los fichièrs, etc. Deuriatz pas modificar o "
"suprimir aquestes fichièrs, levat se sabètz çò que fasètz.</p>"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 151
#: rc.cpp:123
msgid "Align direction"
msgstr "Direccion de l'alinhament"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 152
#: rc.cpp:126
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, icons are aligned vertically, otherwise horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Se aquò es activat, las icònas son alinhadas verticalament, siquenon "
"orizontalament."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 156
#: rc.cpp:129
msgid "Show Icon Previews For"
msgstr "Afichar l'apercebut per"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 157
#: rc.cpp:132
msgid "Select for which types of files you want to enable preview images."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionatz los tipes de fichièrs pelsquals volètz activar los imatges "
"d'apercebut."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 171
#: rc.cpp:135
msgid "Sort criterion"
msgstr "Critèri de triada"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 172
#: rc.cpp:138
msgid ""
"Sets the sort criterion. Possible choices are NameCaseSensitive = 0, "
"NameCaseInsensitive = 1, Size = 2, Type = 3, Date = 4."
msgstr ""
"Definís lo critèri de triada. Las causidas possiblas son : "
"NomSensibleALaCassa = 0, NomInsensibleALaCassa = 1, Talha = 2, Tipe = 3, "
"Data = 4"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 177
#: rc.cpp:144
msgid ""
"Enable this to place directories in front of the sorted list, otherwise they "
"are amongst the files."
msgstr ""
"Activatz aquò per plaçar los dorsièrs en cap de la lista triada, siquenon,  "
"seràn mesclats als fichièrs."

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 182
#: rc.cpp:150
msgid "Check this option if you want to keep your icons from moving."
msgstr "Marcatz aquesta casa per empachar vòstras icònas de bolegar."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 203
#: rc.cpp:157
msgid "Device Types to exclude"
