#: rc.cpp:160
msgid "The device types which you do not want to see on the desktop."
msgstr "Los tipes de periferics que volètz pas veire sul burèu."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 212
#: rc.cpp:163
msgid "Current application's menu bar (Mac OS-style)"
msgstr "Barra de menuts de l'aplicacion correnta (coma Mac OS)"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 213
#: rc.cpp:166
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, applications will not have their menu bar "
"attached to their own window anymore. Instead, there is one menu bar at the "
"top of the screen which shows the menus of the currently active application. "
"You might recognize this behavior from Mac OS."
msgstr ""
"Se aquesta opcion es seleccionada, la barra de menuts de las aplicacions "
"serà pas mai dins la fenèstra de l'aplicacion. Una barra de menuts se "
"trobarà en efièch en naut de l'escran, e aficharà los menuts de l'aplicacion "
"correnta. Benlèu i reconeisseretz lo comportament de Mac OS."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 219
#: rc.cpp:169
msgid "Desktop menu bar"
msgstr "Barra de menuts del burèu"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 220
#: rc.cpp:172
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, there is one menu bar at the top of the screen "
"which shows the desktop menus."
msgstr ""
"Se aquesta opcion es activada, una barra afichant los menuts del burèu serà "
"presenta en naut de l'escran."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 226
#: rc.cpp:175
msgid "Enable screen saver"
msgstr "Activar l'escran de velha"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 227
#: rc.cpp:178
msgid "Enables the screen saver."
msgstr "Activa l'escran de velha"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 231
#: rc.cpp:181
msgid "Screen saver timeout"
msgstr "Sosta de l'escran de velha"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 232
#: rc.cpp:184
msgid "Sets the seconds after which the screen saver is started."
msgstr ""
"Definís lo nombre de segondas d'esperar abans d'aviar l'escran de velha."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 167
#: rc.cpp:233
msgid ""
"<qt>Select whether realtime scheduling should be enabled for the "
"application. The scheduler governs which process will run and which will "
"have to wait. Two schedulers are available:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><em>Normal:</em> This is the standard, timesharing scheduler. It will "
"divide fairly the available processing time between all processes.</li>\n"
"<li><em>Realtime:</em>This scheduler will run your application uninterrupted "
"until it gives up the processor. This can be dangerous. An application that "
"does not give up the processor might hang the system. You need root's "
"password to use the scheduler.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Precisatz se l'ordonançament temps real deu èsser utilizat per "
"l'aplicacion. L'ordonançament es la partida del sistèma d'espleitacion que "
"decida qual processús s'executa e losquals devon esperar. Dos ordonançaments "
"son disponibles :\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><em>Normal : </em>es l'ordonançament costumièr, en temps partejat. "
"Globalament, devesirà equitablament lo temps de tractament disponible entre "
"totes los processús</li>\n"
"<li><em>Temps real : </em>aqueste ordonançament interrompirà pas vòstra "
"aplicacion, fins a que libère lo processor. Aquò pòt èsser dangierós. Una "
"aplicacion que libèra pas lo processeire pòt blocar lo sistèma. Lo senhal "
"del superutilizaire es necessari per utilizar aqueste ordonançament.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 170
#: rc.cpp:241
msgid "Run with realtime &scheduling"
msgstr "Amodar a&mb l'ordonançament temps real"

