msgid "Enter the user you want to run the application as here."
msgstr ""
"Picatz aicí lo nom de l'utilizaire jolqual volètz executar l'aplicacion."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 191
#: rc.cpp:247
msgid "User&name:"
msgstr "&Nom d'usancièr :"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 212
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 230
#: rc.cpp:250 rc.cpp:253
msgid "Enter the password here for the user you specified above."
msgstr "Picatz lo senhal de l'utilizaire qu'avètz especificat çaisús."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 233
#: rc.cpp:256
msgid "Pass&word:"
msgstr "Mot de _pas :"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 243
#: rc.cpp:259
msgid ""
"Check this option if the application you want to run is a text mode "
"application. The application will then be run in a terminal emulator window."
msgstr ""
"Marcatz aquesta opcion se l'aplicacion d'amodar es una aplicacion en mòde "
"tèxt. L'aplicacion serà alara executada dins un terminal."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 246
#: rc.cpp:262
msgid "Run in &terminal window"
msgstr "Executar dins un &terminal"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 264
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 334
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 347
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 371
#: rc.cpp:265 rc.cpp:280 rc.cpp:286 rc.cpp:292
msgid ""
"The priority that the command will be run with can be set here. From left to "
"right, it goes from low to high. The center position is the default value. "
"For priorities higher than the default, you will need to provide the root "
"password."
msgstr ""
"La prioritat de la comanda d'executar pòt èsser definida aicí. D'esquèrra a "
"drecha, varia de bassa a elevada. La posicion al centre es la valor per "
"defaut. Per una prioritat superiora a la per defaut, auretz besonh del "
"senhal del superutilizaire."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 267
#: rc.cpp:268
msgid "&Priority:"
msgstr "&Prioritat :"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 295
#: rc.cpp:271
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different "
"priority. A higher priority tells the operating system to give more "
"processing time to your application."
msgstr ""
"Marcatz aquesta opcion se volètz executar l'aplicacion amb una prioritat "
"diferenta. Una prioritat mai elevada demanda al sistèma d'alogar mai de "
"temps al foncionament de l'aplicacion."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 298
#: rc.cpp:274
msgid "Run with a &different priority"
msgstr "Executar amb una prioritat &diferenta"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 337
#: rc.cpp:283
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Bassa"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 350
#: rc.cpp:289
msgid "High"
msgstr "Nautor :"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 386
#: rc.cpp:295
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different user "
"id. Every process has a user id associated with it. This id code determines "
"file access and other permissions. The password of the user is required to "
"do this."
msgstr ""
"Marcatz aquesta opcion se volètz executar l'aplicacion amb un numèro "
"d'utilizaire diferent. Cada processús possedís un numèro d'utilizaire "
"associat. Aqueste darrièr determina los dreches d'accès als fichièrs e "
"tanben d'autras permissions. Lo senhal de l'utilizaire en question es "
"necessari per far aquò."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 389
#: rc.cpp:298
msgid "Run as a different &user"
msgstr "Executar jos un autre nom d'&utilizaire"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 443
#. i18n: tag string
