"Enter the command you wish to execute or the address of the resource you "
"want to open. This can be a remote URL like \"www.kde.org\" or a local one "
"like \"~/.kderc\"."
msgstr ""
"Picatz la comanda que volètz executar o l'adreça de la ressorsa que volètz "
"dobrir. Aquò pòt èsser una URL distanta coma « www.kde.org » o locala coma "
"« ~/.kderc »."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 446
#: rc.cpp:304
msgid "Com&mand:"
msgstr "Co&manda :"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file minicli.ui line 503
#: rc.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the application you want to run or the URL you want to view"
msgstr "Picatz lo nom de l'aplicacion d'executar o l'URL que volètz consultar."

